const world=`WORLD_ID: finanzneo-connected-studio-v3\nSERIES_LOCK_ID: finanzneo-same-world-v1\nGENERATED_IMAGE_ASPECT_RATIO: 16:9\nIMAGE_STORYTELLING_STANDARD: finanzneo-image-storytelling-v3\n\nLiteral first, creative second. Premium stylized 3D FinanzNeo world, one seamless deep-black background, vivid emerald and mint, gold only for value/money, warm red-orange only for loss/risk. Never photorealistic. The concrete ETF situation must be understandable without subtitles. No generic finance-icon collage, no dashboard as main composition, no conveyor/portal/cage/machine metaphor unless literally required.\n`;
